//JEI INTEGRATION
jei.deepnullreforged.desc=The DeepNull is a spiritual successor and upgraded version of the OpenBlocks /dev/null/.
jei.deepnullreforged.desc0=\nThe §4§lRedstone§r DeepNull (MK I) is the lowest tier with 9 slots and up to 2 stacks in each slot.
jei.deepnullreforged.desc1=\nThe §9§lLapis§r DeepNull (MK II) is the 2nd tier with 18 slots and up to 4 stacks in each slot.
jei.deepnullreforged.desc2=\nThe §8§lIron§r DeepNull (MK III) is the 3rd tier with 27 slots and up to 8 stacks in each slot.
jei.deepnullreforged.desc3=\nThe §6§lGold§r DeepNull (MK IV) is the 4th tier with 36 slots and up to 16 stacks in each slot.
jei.deepnullreforged.desc4=\nThe §b§lDiamond§r DeepNull (MK IV) is the 5th tier with 45 slots and up to 32 stacks in each slot.
jei.deepnullreforged.desc5=The §2§lEmerald§r DeepNull (MK VI) is the top tier with 54 slots and up to 2.14 billion of an item per slot.
jei.deepnull_dock.desc=-Right-click with DeepNull in-hand to place DeepNull in docking station\n-Items can only be extracted from the DeepNull, not inserted-from bottom.\n-Speed is determined by block that is pulling from the dock.

